160
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,700
best way is to ask the people there.

161
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:13,240
I may talk to people at a street market or take a walk and look for a place myself.

162
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:17,160
I never ask a hotel clerk or a taxi driver.

